975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-19T16:40:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T16:40:28Z","body":"Some context from https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13584#issuecomment-3538801477 where this was initially discussed:\n\n> And I think I know what is happening. The new embedded feature changes a specific detail in regards to engine focus. When a DAP connection is present, [we disable engine focus stealing](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/editor/debugger/debug_adapter/debug_adapter_protocol.cpp#L153); otherwise, both the engine and IDE would be competing for focus whenever breakpoints are hit. But this was done back in the day with the assumption that the game process launches on a different window, and steals focus whenever execution resumes.\n>\n> With embedded mode, this has now changed. The engine itself handles the game window, so we probably want to allow the engine to steal focus in that case. I've tested this now on my setup on Linux, and indeed when the game is embedded, it does not focus the game window at all now.\n\nSo this is not exclusive to macOS; I've replicated it on Linux with a similar setup. I'll also test on Windows in a bit to confirm that is not OS-dependent. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3553681316/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557993566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112883#issuecomment-3557993566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112883","id":3557993566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UEqxe","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T13:13:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T13:13:04Z","body":"I've confirmed that focusing on embedded instances on Windows doesn't work either, so very likely it's the issue I mentioned.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557993566/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]